{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Return to the world of the Dancer.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this free DLC, take on a new horrifying threat as you navigate the aftermath of the events of the Dancer: Chapter 3. In this horror-focused experience, explore a ruined labyrinth crawling with dark secrets, strange artefacts and the remains of something that once was...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A new experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Dancer: Chapter 4 launches as a separate application to the rest of The Dancer: Definitive Edition, and because of this it can offer a vast new range of experiences. As well as featuring a full story campaign, there are plenty of secrets to find!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take Initiative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This chapter features this which may be relevant to another project Spacepiano Games is working on at the moment... Keep your eyes peeled.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3473930?t=1746106083","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3473930?t=1746106083","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473930/52abfc5a92640956e4aaab9789e424e56a574d55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746106083","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473930/52abfc5a92640956e4aaab9789e424e56a574d55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746106083","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Return to the world of the Dancer.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this free DLC, take on a new horrifying threat as you navigate the aftermath of the events of the Dancer: Chapter 3. In this horror-focused experience, explore a ruined labyrinth crawling with